#* {{quote-text|year=1907|author=Kemp Plummer Battle|title=History of the University of North Carolina: From its beginning to the death of President Swain, 1789-1868|volume=1|page=574|url=http://books.google.com.au/books?id=vKBGAQAAIAAJ&q=%22fictionary%22&dq=%22fictionary%22&hl=en&sa=X&ei=PJsmU-e7AsbpkAX1_4DoDg&redir_esc=y|passage=Showing a lady into a library in which were alcoves, the books being arranged by subjects, he said, "Now, Miss Mary, I will show you the concave{{sic}} of '''fictionary''' novels."'}}

