#* {{quote-text|year=2010|author=Wanda Urbanska|title=The Heart of Simple Living: 7 Paths to a Better Life|page=223|url=http://books.google.com.au/books?id=YJ7N1llHJ74C&pg=PA223&dq=%22fictionary%22&hl=en&sa=X&ei=PJsmU-e7AsbpkAX1_4DoDg&redir_esc=y#v=onepage&q=%22fictionary%22&f=false|passage=Turns out, it's reminiscent of the game of '''Fictionary''' that was the hit of a recent Thanksgiving at my home (see below).}}